          }
        ]
      },
      "worked": "Offer A gives a 10% discount on both boxes. Offer B charges full price for one box and half price for the other.\n$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Offer A total} &= 2\\times\\text{£}5\\times0.90\\\\\\text{Offer A total} &= \\text{£}9.00\\\\\\text{Offer B total} &= \\text{£}5.50+\\text{£}5.50\\times0.50\\\\\\text{Offer B total} &= \\text{£}8.25\\\\\\text{Difference} &= \\text{£}9.00-\\text{£}8.25\\\\\\text{Difference} &= \\text{£}0.75\\end{align*}$$\nOption B is the better deal by £0.75.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
